-- changelog.md: Changelog (order 7)
<h1 id="changelog">Changelog<a class="headerlink" href="#changelog" title="Permanent link">&para;</a></h1>
<h2 id="092-2026-09-30">0.9.2 &ndash; 2026-09-30<a class="headerlink" href="#092-2026-09-30" title="Permanent link">&para;</a></h2>
<ul>
<li>Fixed: an npm tarball with a <code>+</code> in its version was stored under the
  wrong key (<a href="https://git.example.invalid/harbor/issues/212" title="npm versions with build metadata">#212</a>).</li>
<li>Fixed: <code>harbor gc</code> no longer follows symlinks out of <code>data_dir</code>.</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="090-2026-08-14">0.9.0 &ndash; 2026-08-14<a class="headerlink" href="#090-2026-08-14" title="Permanent link">&para;</a></h2>
<ul>
<li>New: the S3 blob store (beta). See <a class="wikilink" href="/Configuration/">Configuration</a>.</li>
<li>New: <code>harbor token list --expired</code>.</li>
<li>Changed: the default <code>max_upload</code> is now 200 MiB (was 100 MiB).</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="080-2026-06-02">0.8.0 &ndash; 2026-06-02<a class="headerlink" href="#080-2026-06-02" title="Permanent link">&para;</a></h2>
<ul>
<li>New: yanking, for both PyPI and npm releases.</li>
<li>Removed: the <code>--legacy-paths</code> flag, deprecated since 0.6.</li>
</ul>
-- toc
<div class="toc">
<ul>
